;; 90-docs/task-graphs/task-graph.datoms.edn — base catalog of task-dependency
;; graphs ("workflows"), DataScript/Datomic-transactable tx-data (same shape
;; as 90-docs/adr/*.edn). This file declares TOPOLOGY ONLY (workflow ids,
;; task ids, :task/requires edges) — it is never hand-rewritten to reflect
;; progress. Progress (started/completed/blocked) is recorded as append-only
;; events in 90-docs/task-graphs/task-graph-ledger.edn (via
;; scripts/task-graph-ledger-append.cljs) and PROJECTED against this base by
;; scripts/task-graph-query.cljs's `ready-tasks` — the same
;; base-file+append-only-ledger split used by 90-docs/adr-ledger/adr-ledger.edn
;; and 90-docs/business/canvas-ledger.edn, for the same reason (DataScript has
;; no as-of/history API; re-parsing a hand-edited base loses the trail).
;; See ADR-2607202800.
;;
;; Adding a new workflow: append a new :workflow/id block + its :task/id
;; entries to this vector (this file itself IS append-friendly at the
;; workflow granularity — only *existing* entries must not be rewritten).
;; :task/requires lists sibling :task/id strings within the same workflow.

